{"version":1,"content":"<p>OpenAI發佈最新技術報告《Advancing chip design with OpenAI models》，披露其利用人工智能模型輔助晶片設計的最新進展。OpenAI表示，其模型不僅幫助自研AI推理晶片Jalapeño優化了電路設計，還在與AMD的合作中，實現旗艦GPU關鍵IP模塊最高<strong>14%的功耗、性能和面積（PPA）指標改善</strong>。部分優化成果已被AMD納入近期提交製造的晶片設計。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587048.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:24:10.862039+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T03:15:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T03:17:21.541114+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T03:17:21.541114+00:00","content_hash":"912f647c9d46229e9d9eff3ac955134f19221a43dbdcac92921435cd49ccdb0d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}